    "https://www.jobs.ac.uk/job/DTH174/engineering-wmg-mphil-phd": {
      "title": "Engineering (WMG) MPhil/PhD",
      "description": "Engineering (WMG) MPhil/PhD at University of Warwick Find a Job Find PhDs Career Advice PhDs by Email Advertise a Job Recruiters Find a Job Find PhDs Career Advice PhDs by Email Advertise a Job Your Account Recruiters Back to search results Engineering (WMG) MPhil/PhD University of Warwick – WMG (Warwick Manufacturing Group) Be part of a diverse research community striving to push the boundaries of science and technology. Join an international community of scholars and business leaders, renowned for their impact in academia and industry. World-leading academics will guide you to become an expert in your chosen field. You will have opportunities to attend conferences to speak about your research, where you will make valuable connections with leading academics and companies. The PhD at WMG, University of Warwick is concentrated on a contribution to knowledge. It requires you to discover, interpret and communicate new knowledge through original research, and to present and defend research outcomes which extend across the forefront of your chosen discipline. You will combine doctoral-level research with real industrial relevance in a department globally renowned for academic excellence, business focus, industry collaboration and impact in the competitive marketplace. For more information and to apply please click the 'Apply' button above. Qualification Type: PhD Location: Coventry, Warwick Funding amount: Not Specified Hours: Full Time, Part Time Placed On: 15th October 2026 Expires: 15th January 2027 Reference: P-H7A2 Share on social media We value your feedback on the quality of our adverts.\n            If you have a comment to make about the overall quality of this advert,\n            or its categorisation then please send us your feedback Show all PhDs for University of Warwick … Advert information Type / Role: Subject Area(s): Location(s): PhD tools Save this job Login to Save Job Max Saved Jobs Reached × Max Saved Jobs Reached A maximum of 